Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>02/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b>02/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date :<strong>19-26 May 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<b>16/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <strong>10/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>13/06/2026</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6627%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"377\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS: <b>3000/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>2000/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 31/12/2026</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>17 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>NA</strong></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per ABVMU, Lucknow UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET 2026 Admissions Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Uttar Pradesh GNM Admissions 2026:&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Admissions Details<br>\n</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.4217%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"209\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.488%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"510\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET 2026 Eligibility<br>\n</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.4217%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"209\">\n<p align=\"center\">GNM Course 3 Year</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.488%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"510\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate with English 40% Marks.</li>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate with English 40% Marks in Vocational ANM Course.</li>\n<li>Registered ANM with Passing Marks.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>ABVMU UPGET 2026 Admissions : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Exam District Details</span><br>\n</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Agra, Aligarh, Ayodhya, Azamgarh, bareilly, Basti, Banda, Ghaziabad, Gonda, Gorakhpur, Jhansi, Kanpur.</li>\n<li>Lucknow Meerut, Mirzapur, Moradabad, Prayagraj (Allahabad), Saharanpur, Varanasi &amp; Gautam Buddha Nagar. More Details Read the UPGNM 2026 Information Brochure</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill Common Paramedical Test ABVMU UPGET 2026Online Form<br>\n</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Cast Certificate Instruction :</b> &nbsp;OBC and EWS certificate should be issued after<b> 01/04/2026.</b></li>\n<li><b>Photo Instruction :</b> The photograph should be full face, from front, with <b>white background</b> and without spectacles along with the <b>name of the candidate and date of photograph</b> should be written on the photograph.</li>\n<li><strong>Live Photo :</strong> UPGET 2026 Live Photo Also Required</li>\n<li>Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, Uttar Pradesh GNM Entrance Test GET 2026 Notification Released. Candidate Can Apply From <b> 29/04/2026&nbsp; to 26/05/2026.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Application Form in Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU Lucknow Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.<b></b></li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full ABVMU UP GET Admission 2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3233%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.5864%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.9097%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.996%;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9137%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"ABVMU UP GNM Admit Card\" href=\"https://www.abvmucet26.co.in/entrance2026/login?form=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Check Exam City</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Check Exam CIty Details\" href=\"https://www.abvmucet26.co.in/entrance2026/login?form=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></